e I am less strong"},{"id":"competenties-046","d":7,"k":1,"q":"I deliberately practise something I am not yet good at"},{"id":"competenties-047","d":7,"k":-1,"q":"I have a good picture of my work and do not need to test it"},{"id":"competenties-048","d":7,"k":-1,"q":"I find it uncomfortable to hear what could be better"}]
